1:1: unknown component <Missing>; the known components are Badge, Callout, Card, Cards, Feature, Steps, Tab, Tabs
3:1: `kind="danger"` on <Callout> is invalid: expected one of note, tip, important, warning, or caution
5:1: <Callout> has no `tone` attribute
7:1: <Card> needs a `title` attribute
9:1: spread attributes such as `{...props}` are not supported
11:1: HTML attributes take text: write `class="…"` on <div> instead of braces
13:1: <br> cannot have children; close it with `<br />`
15:1: <span> cannot take spread attributes
17:1: `count="many"` on <Badge> is invalid: invalid digit found in string
